WEBVTT

00:14:28.636 --> 00:14:33.436
You know, it's very hard to be empathetic
and to be brave when you're exhausted.

00:14:34.156 --> 00:14:37.116
And I think people are really
exhausted right now.

00:14:38.036 --> 00:14:39.836
I think the second is, I do this,

00:14:39.836 --> 00:14:43.716
I think we’ve got to keep talking
to people who don’t agree with us.

00:14:44.076 --> 00:14:48.196
You know, my favorite audiences
to talk about "Pay Up" are men.

00:14:48.916 --> 00:14:51.996
And people always say to me,
"Well, how do you convince the men?"

00:14:52.036 --> 00:14:54.076
I'm like, no, the men
are with me, with us.

00:14:54.116 --> 00:14:56.596
We think they're not, but they are.

00:14:56.996 --> 00:14:58.756
And so it’s everyone’s perspective:

00:14:58.796 --> 00:15:02.356
"The reason why we don't have these things
in this book is because of men."